        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K5010, Solid Brass 6-1/4\" Lion Head Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Lion Door Knocker will add opulence to any door. The detailing grants this front door knocker an ornateness that makes this lion head door knocker is reminiscent of the Victorian Age. It measures 6-1/4 inches high and 4 inches wide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are \r\nhand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 6-1/4\" lion head door knocker is just a slightly smaller version of the ever popular larger <a href=\"/products/7-1-2-lion-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5000\">7 1/2\" Lion Head Knocker</a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nClick here for <a href=\"/products/8-3-8-leo-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5100\">Leo Door Knocker</a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Brass Accents A07-K5010 Lion Head Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height : 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lion Head Mounting Plate Height: 4-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lion Head Mounting Plate Width: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection off Door: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\n** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available. \r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
